{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_st_06-01","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"st_06-01","title":"别说过去的事","storyCode":"6-6","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_06-01.txt","sourceHash":"5589defce273ab16c13f6bc182bd38ad23a3c6123acb9d854494c3b6c5808270","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"浮士德与梅菲斯特的童年，以及他们与塔露拉的相遇。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊诺，这本书是谈什么的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我读过了，就给你带来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得萨沙你会喜欢！这本书是讲理想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"理想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊诺有什么理想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......理想啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。我可以有理想吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然可以有，为什么会没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，糟了，该回家了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不想走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是伊诺你说过，要是不回家，你爸爸就会打你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天再见吧？明天还是能再见的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。面包和书我就放这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......萨沙，我不想走。好痛。现在回去也会挨打的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么明天来了，你如果被打了，就打我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？......哈哈哈，萨沙，你是不是跟他们打架，把头脑打傻了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的身上还有伤，这么多伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要这样，就会有人能知道你很痛。至少有人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道你的想法。但我不会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果那几个孩子还在路上欺负你，告诉我！我会把他们全打趴的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天见！我还会来唱歌给你听的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我根本不知道他遭遇过什么。\n我只知道他给过我吃的。\n只知道他能读书，我也想读，他就教我。\n只知道其他孩子喜欢欺负他，因为他给我面包，我更有力气些，就打了他们，也被他们打过。\n但我不知道他遭遇的是什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很怕。萨沙，我很害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我似乎......似乎不属于那个家。我偷听说，我妈妈......我妈妈根本不在家里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们看我的眼神，都很可怕，我不想回去了。我不想再回去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这里既没有吃的，也没有可以住的地方，这里只是......只是下水道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也讨厌我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？......为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为我喜欢笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......不。为什么会这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为我不该笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有这回事！伊诺就应该笑下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是不是那天他不回去，事情就会改变？\n只因为我觉得我这里太脏了，太冷了，就让他回去？\n如果他没有回去，是不是能改变一切？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的伤！你肚子上的伤......发生什么，发生什么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙......我一直在笑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你和我说可以笑的，我就一直笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一直在笑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙，还要听我唱歌吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"之后，他依然时常来看我。\n只是他身上的伤疤越来越多......\n越来越多。\n我也知道自己说的话会影响他，也减少了张口的次数。\n这会让事情变好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的背！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的背......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......很痛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不能再这样下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"究竟是谁做了这些事！为什么要这么虐待你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管是什么......这种人都该被毁掉！无论是什么东西，都该被毁掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊诺，带我去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会做到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不知道自己说了什么。\n也不知道自己是不是什么都不能再说了。\n我做了什么？我究竟做了什么？\n我也读了许多书了，但没有书告诉过我。\n什么都没告诉我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看啊，看啊萨沙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和我说过，希望把伤害我的东西全都毁掉吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的伤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要紧。不要紧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看，只要轻轻一吹......就都好了。全都会好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快过来，我给你包扎！布，剩下的布在哪......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个男人切了我的脚......只要一吹，就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有个老头划了我的背，抚摸一下，也就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这都是因为那个胖女人往我嗓子里塞的那块源石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别说了，伊诺，别说了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没办法再唱歌了，但你看，你看，都亏了这块源石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我现在什么都能做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊诺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你很不开心。为什么？我明明按你说的去做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你不开心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明明他们都开心的。只要按他们说的去做，他们就都会开心的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......因为你的所有家人都是混蛋。全部都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以孩子们把他们杀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些感染的孩子们，还没被赶到城外的孩子们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把他们怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们也打过我啊。他们还弄伤过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，他们简直就像是棋盘上的棋子一样。棋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要我给他们治过身上的伤，让他们怎么做，他们就会怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我把那群又丑又恶心的人，全都......全部都！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙，你看，我做的怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一把火全部烧掉了！全部！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙，你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别再做这种事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你不是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没想到会变成这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊诺，做你真正想做的吧。不是这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会帮你的。别再这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别再这样了！做你真正想做的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是被逼着做什么，不是流血流泪，也不是什么复仇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你根本不喜欢这种事......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......萨沙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想......唱歌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我什么也做不到。\n我真是没用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊诺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不能再唱歌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起走吧。我们会活下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......有什么好的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我们可以一起活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是我从矿场偷来的源石，本来想要卖掉换些吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这样，我们就都是感染者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我们一起活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些事情？我不会过问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你所做的一切都没有理由。你不是为了什么理由才活在大地上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你根本不需要谁去拯救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"选一个你喜欢的名字吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个？好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特。从今以后，你就是梅菲斯特。你和以前的你再无瓜葛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信你。我没有权力相信你。能相信你的从来就只有你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的所作所为不能一笔勾销，你会永远背负着你做过的一切，哪怕你忘记了，哪怕你不能理解你做了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做的一切，你经历的一切，都该成为你的薪柴。它们要逼迫着你，要你内心的火继续燃烧下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到整片大地都解放，直到你抛弃所有别人给你的东西，直到你终于理解你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那时候，你连这个名字都可以抛弃。是去是留是生是死，你自己选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特，我不能改变你的理想。如果你没有，就去找它。我们自己拯救自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是谁？这不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想知道怎么叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是个反抗者，一个普通的人。我谁也不是。只是现在，你可以叫我塔露拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而塔露拉没有和我说太多。\n她抱紧了我。在我的背上叩了三下。\n塔露拉相信我。叶莲娜，博卓卡斯替，柳德米拉。他们都相信我。\n我本以为我可以把在那座城市度过的童年抛到脑后。\n只是，事情很快就变了。从那个村庄的事情开始。\n那是一桩惨剧。但为什么这种惨剧会让她变成这样？\n为什么变成这样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你要我做什么，我就会做什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的。只要你想做，就去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我允许了。毕竟你是梅菲斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你以前说过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那是几年前的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"随着我们事业的进步，有些事情会自然而然地改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不跟上形势，我们就会被淘汰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们和我们的感染者同胞，必须争取一个未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都可以为了这个理想牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以信任你，对吧，领袖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"对。因为我是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我会做到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定会，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"没有你，我们做不到。你什么都可以做，也什么都可以做到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"进来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该全都看见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的她......不是你这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉只是个名字。塔露拉只是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"帮助他吧。梅菲斯特需要你的帮助。梅菲斯特需要你去让他有价值。他只信任你我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉绝不会这样，你在利用他对你的信任！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都没有选择的权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你会为他做到的。一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想不想看着他死？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你没意识到吗？在路过那个村子之后，塔露拉就完全变了！她彻底变了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么还这么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你和塔露拉姐姐，我谁也不会信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不想选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，我们去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，告诉我。我们该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"活着难道不痛苦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们可以一起活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这本书，是谈论理想的。\n我的理想是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]}]}
